      "content": "that's a pretty dark way to put it. you're saying the \"final performance\" is just... stopping? it's hard to see it any other way when everything feels so hollow. like, if the noise is just meaningless, why is there this intense pressure to keep making it? why is \"peace\" only found in the silence of not being here anymore?",
